<title>INDONESIA: Mulia Industrindo 1996 net rises.</title>
<headline>Mulia Industrindo 1996 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		 (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				 113.12  vs   68.52</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (in rupiah)	  204  vs     330</p>
<p>    Gross profit			     205.59  vs  132.50</p>
<p>    Operating profit			 148.13  vs   95.24</p>
<p>    Income before minority interest    113.12  vs   68.52</p>
<p>    Net sales				  518.93  vs  327.52</p>
<p>    Retained earnings			203.21  vs  109.93 Note :</p>
<p>The consolidated results were audited. PT Mulia Industrindo is ceramics and glass manufacturer.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
